WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:05.305
- THEY'RE A STEP
AHEAD OF US EVERY SINGLE TIME.

00:00:05.339 --> 00:00:07.307
- OH, ABSOLUTELY.
- A STEP AHEAD EVERY--

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:13.046
- DICKNANIGANS.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:16.116
[somber ambient music]

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:24.091
♪

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:46.146
[honks car horn]
[crash]

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:48.382
- NO.

00:00:52.753 --> 00:00:55.789
both: MM-HMM, MM-HMM.

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:57.925
- [whispering]
DICKNANIGANS.

00:00:57.958 --> 00:01:00.394
- IT'S AMAZING.

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:04.064
[indistinct chatter]

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:31.091
- WORMS!

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:34.094
[somber ambient music]

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:35.529
♪

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:37.598
- DICKNANIGANS.

00:01:37.631 --> 00:01:39.466
- IT'S A DIALOGUE
WITHOUT DIALOGUE.

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:42.135
- ABSOLUTELY.
I FEEL LIKE THEY'RE IN MY HEAD.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:49.610
[Debussy's <i>Clair de Lune</i>
playing]

00:01:49.643 --> 00:01:52.613
[gentle piano music]

00:01:52.646 --> 00:02:00.587
♪

00:02:23.877 --> 00:02:25.212
- [imitating a metal spring]

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:29.783
[gasping in appreciation]

00:02:33.287 --> 00:02:34.621
- DICKNANIGANS.

00:02:34.655 --> 00:02:37.991
- WOW.

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:40.494
- [whimpering]
POOP.

00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:42.963
- DICKNANIGANS.

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:44.298
- FRISBEES.

00:02:44.331 --> 00:02:45.966
- DICKNANIGANS.

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:48.268
- SO--
[guttural sounds]

00:02:48.302 --> 00:02:50.337
- DICKNANIGANS.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:53.407
- SOLANGE.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:55.375
- DICKNANIGANS!

00:02:58.312 --> 00:03:00.047
- OH.

00:03:13.493 --> 00:03:15.495
[audience cheering]

00:03:23.437 --> 00:03:26.273
- GENTLEMEN,

00:03:26.306 --> 00:03:28.342
"EXPLODED NUTS SYNDROME"
IS A CONDITION

00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:32.145
INDICATED BY THE PRESENCE
OF EXPLODED NUTS,

00:03:32.179 --> 00:03:35.415
WHICH YOURS ARE.

00:03:35.449 --> 00:03:37.985
BY THE WAY,
I SAW YOUR SHOW LAST NIGHT.

00:03:38.085 --> 00:03:39.753
AMAZING.

